DTEND:20250525T004500Z
DTSTAMP:20250524T230000Z
UID:a42s3RlPkQ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nPursuing social and personal oppo
 rtunities\, these queer individuals strive to break through obstacles and 
 forge on.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/queering-the-way\n\nFilm is als
 o being streamed.
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
